xt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q8424$070EEBB4-7A50-447A-85CD-352E7F4F9F27", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "93db755a4e0587d1a51e0f2eab727b54b01e10b6", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 869, "id": "Q869"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q8424$4D64E7E6-F9E6-49AA-82DE-76FB64ABBD65", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "5654edd4de92ef53c826932b50ec15867fb66aee", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 853, "id": "Q853"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q8424$F0229105-976C-4515-BDDB-5BF00736F393", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "c7c50753485caee25178bc7cc8e97a884d642bdf", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 853, "id": "Q853"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q8424$A7AEF1AD-E1F9-4B38-B1AD-985191ACFFC5", "rank": "normal"}], "P19": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P19", "hash": "ffbed4d7e3ce5ab5704bd330c8abc6bc728b0764", "datavalue": {"value": "Yeah. And they were always good -- \"Honeysuckle Rose.\" So the trick was to point out to people that it wasn't a new repertoire that Ralph was doing even though this is a brand new CD, what to expect from it. It's not that he ever played badly, because Ralph I think was just a wonderful musician. But there were some musicians who tended to do the same repertoire. So that was one problem in cover...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q8424$690A3262-20C7-4781-A2C3-AF3538BB6817", "rank": "normal"}]}}